        <mxCell id="leg1" value="&lt;b&gt;Mode 1&lt;/b&gt;  (real_time=False)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#39;font-size:9px&#39;&gt;• historical_file resolved at /start&lt;br&gt;• Workflow Thread runs process sequence&lt;br&gt;• Commands from run_workflow()&lt;br&gt;• Clock runs at CPU speed&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
